ts\n\nProject Status\n\nReady To Move\n\nRera Status\n\nRegistered\n\nWhy you should consider Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B?\n\n* Architectural excellence and living at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B.\n* Prime location in Kandivali West, Mumbai.\n* A highly lucrative Ready To Move investment in Kandivali West, Mumbai.\n\n[About](#sec-overview) [Project Highlights](#sec-details) [Floor Plans](#sec-floorplan) [Photos & Videos](#sec-photos) [Amenities](#sec-amenities) [RERA Details](#sec-rera) [Map & Location](#sec-map) [About Developer](#sec-developer) [Similar Projects](#sec-similar)\n\n## About Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n![Rathi Global Realty](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/front_assets/assets/psweb/images/why-consider-badge.svg)\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B is a residential project by Rustomjee, located in the prestigious Kandivali West, Mumbai. Designed as a Apartment, the project offers spacious and thoughtfully crafted 2 BHK Flats residences tailored for modern living. It is currently in the Ready To Move stage with possession expected by N/A. The project reflects world-class planning, superior engineering excellence, and refined luxury living.\n\nThe plush residences range from varied sizes and include thoughtfully designed layouts with 2 Bedrooms.\n\nFrom the grand entrance lobby to the elegantly designed interiors, every aspect of the project defines sophistication and attention to detail. Residents can enjoy world-class lifestyle amenities such as a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, wellness and fitness centres, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, sports facilities, kids' play areas, and more.\n\nStrategically connected to major roads such as\n\n* **Kidzee Pre School** (School) - 0.2 km\n* **Orlem Church** (Bus Stop) - 0.4 km\n* **Marve Nursing Home And Polyclinic** (Hospital) - 0.4 km\n\n, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, business hubs, and entertainment centres, making it a lucrative residential destination.\n\nThe project is registered under RERA No. A51800000454, ensuring seamless transparency and buyer confidence. Buyers can explore detailed floor plans, project images, specifications, and master layouts through the official brochure and sales gallery. Flexible payment plans are available for both investors and homebuyers. Priced at ₹2.55 Cr Onwards, Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B offers strong potential for long-term appreciation and rental yield due to its premium location, luxury infrastructure, and trusted developer reputation.\n\nWhether you are an end-user looking for an upscale lifestyle or an investor seeking capital appreciation, Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B offers a compelling opportunity in one of Mumbai's fastest-growing luxury corridors.\n\n[+ Read More](javascript:void(0))\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Project Highlights\n\n* Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B is a premium Apartment featuring 2 BHK Flats residences.\n* Situated in the prime locality of Kandivali West, Mumbai, offering excellent long-term appreciation.\n* Currently in its Ready To Move phase, aligning perfectly with your investment timeline.\n* Experience seamless day-to-day living at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B with Power Backup, Lift.\n* Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B possesses an advanced and multi-tier security system with 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Intercom Facility.\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Floor Plans\n\n700 sq.ft\n\nFloor plan image coming soon\n\n2 BHK 700 sq.ft Apartment\n\n## Build Your Ideal Unit\n\nConfiguration\n\nFloor Bond\n\nSelect Facing\n\nYour selection0 Taps\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Photos & Videos\n\nExplore Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B's gallery to see luxury come to life in our stunning interiors, views, and amenities.\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Amenities\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B, located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, offers a sophisticatedly created collection of world-class amenities designed to elevate your everyday living. Blending luxury, wellness, and leisure, this iconic residential landmark development features Power Backup, Lift and Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits. Every corner of the property is crafted to deliver tranquility.\n\n![Power Backup](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/generator.svg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![Lift](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/elevator.svg)\n\nLift\n\n![24 x 7 Security](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/security.svg)\n\n24 x 7 Security\n\n![CCTV / Video Surveillance](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/security-camera.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![Intercom Facility](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/amenities/intercom.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\nKids' Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\nNormal Park / Central Green\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B RERA Details\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B stands as a benchmark for legal transparency and regulatory excellence. Fully approved and registered with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority (RERA), Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B adheres to all government compliance and consumer protection standards. The official registration details are as follows: Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B is registered under RERA with registration number A51800000454. Project registration details and related approvals can be checked through the official RERA portal using the registered number.\n\nRead more\n\nA51800000454\n\n![RERA QR](https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data=A51800000454)\n\n## Nearby Landmarks - Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n## Check Travel Time\n\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B]()\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\nKandivali West\n\n## How does Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B compare with other top projects?\n\nCompare Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B with similar projects. Evaluate pricing, configurations, possession timelines, and project scale to find the best fit for your needs.\n\nNo Image\n\nCurrent Project\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice₹2.55 Cr\\* Onwards\n\nPer Sq. FtN/A\n\nConfiguration