oject.\n\nTo book a unit or enquire about Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B, contact our property expert at [+917797009700](tel:+917797009700) or fill in the enquiry form on this page.\n\nThe developer of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B is Rustomjee.\n\nResidents at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B enjoy a wide range of luxury amenities including Power Backup, Lift, Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits.\n\nExclusive benefits and flexible construction-linked payment plans for Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B are currently available for early bookings.\n\nYes, Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B presents a promising investment opportunity due to its strategic location, quality development, modern amenities, and strong potential for long-term appreciation.\n\n**Disclaimer:** The information provided on this page is for general informational purposes only and does not constitute an offer, warranty, or representation by Rathi Global Realty Services. Project details including pricing, configurations, RERA registration, and availability are sourced from public records, State RERA websites, builder websites, and authorized channel partners. This content is presented solely for user research and reference purposes. Rathi Global Realty Services does not own or guarantee the accuracy of third-party content. Users are advised to independently verify all details with the builder or promoter before making any purchase decision.\n\nLast Updated: 10 Jul 2026\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B — Photos\n\n![]()\n\nSales Team\n\nReal Estate Advisor\n\n+91 77-9700-9700\n\n[![Call](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/front_assets/assets/psweb/images/call-icon.webp) Call Now](tel:+917797009700)   [![WhatsApp](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/front_assets/assets/psweb/images/whatsapp-icon.webp) WhatsApp](https://wa.me/7797009700?text=Hi%2C+I+am+interested+in+Rustomjee+Adarsh+Regal+B.+Please+share+details.)\n\n![Rathi Global Realty](https://www.rathiglobalrealty.com/uploads/logo/1777987165-logo-gold.png)\n\nRegister Here And Avail the Best Offers