 Studio, Apartment\n\n₹ 59.99 Lac to 1.70 Cr\n\n![DPS Greens residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dps-greens-project-project-large-image1-5021.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.24 Cr to 2.50 Cr\n\n![Paradigm Ananda Phase 2 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/paradigm-ananda-phase-2-project-project-large-image1-6736.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 99.00 Lac to 1.52 Cr\n\n![Kalpataru Avenue residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-avenue-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Yugdharma residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-yugdharma-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair Shyam residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.60 Cr to 2.27 Cr\n\n![Kalpataru Vatika residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-vatika-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n### Is Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B more expensive than under-construction projects nearby?\n\nReady to Move projects like Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B may be priced slightly higher, but they eliminate construction delays, GST, and rental overlap costs.\n\n### What are the maintenance charges at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B?\n\nMaintenance charges at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B depend on the apartment size and society services and are payable monthly or annually.\n\n### What are the popular amenities available at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B?\n\nResidents of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B can enjoy amenities such as Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits, Power Backup, Lift, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Normal Park / Central Green, designed for comfort and a modern lifestyle.\n\n### What configurations are available at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B?\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B offers 2 BHK Flats catering to different space and budget requirements.\n\n### Can I visit the actual flat at Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B before buying?\n\nYes, since Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B is a Ready to Move project in Kandivali West, buyers can arrange site visits and inspect the actual apartment before finalizing the deal.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rustomjee-rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-by-rustomjee-constructions-in-malad-west-mumbai","title":"Rustomjee Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B in Malad West, Mumbai by Rustomjee - RealEstateIndia.Com","raw_content":"[![RealEstateIndia.Com - India's Property Portal](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/realestateindia-logo.svg) ![RealEstateIndia.Com](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/realestateindia-icon.svg)](https://www.realestateindia.com \"RealEstateIndia.Com\")\n\nMumbai\n\nSearch from Over 2500 Cities **-** All India\n\nPOPULAR CITIES\n\n* [Delhi](https://www.realestateindia.com/delhi-property/ \"Delhi Property\")\n* [Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/ \"Mumbai 