6 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project9823/proj_header_image-9823-350x350.jpg)\n\nRustomjee Seasons\n\n[Luxurious Apartments](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rustomjee-seasons-by-rustomjee-in-mumbai/)\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\n8.20 Cr.-8.60 Cr.\n\n2000-3025 /Sq.ft.\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n## Frequently asked questions\n\n1. Where is Rustomjee Located?\n\n   Rustomjee is located in Malad West, Mumbai.\n2. What type of property can I find in Rustomjee?\n\n   You can easily find 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments in Rustomjee.\n3. What is the size of 2 BHK apartment in Rustomjee?\n\n   The approximate size of a 2 BHK apartment here is 1008 Sq.ft.\n4. What is the size of 3 BHK apartment in Rustomjee?\n\n   The approximate size of a 3 BHK apartment here is 1550 Sq.ft.\n5. By when can I gain possession of property in Rustomjee?\n\n   You can get complete possession of your property here by Apr 2012.\n\n## Rustomjee Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Get Best Offer on this Project\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![Ekta Meadows](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project2/morya-2.jpg \"Ekta Meadows\")\n\n[Ekta Meadows](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/ekta-meadows-by-ekta-shelters-pvt-ltd-in-kandivali-east-mumbai-pjid-2/)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n1.17 Cr.-1.80 Cr.\n\n1.0, 2.0 BHK Flats & Apartments\n\n![Oberoi Garden](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project3/proj_img-3_3.jpg \"Oberoi Garden\")\n\n[Oberoi Garden](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/oberoi-garden-by-oberoi-realty-limited-in-kandivali-mumbai/)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2.80 Cr.\n\n3.0 BHK Flats & Apartments\n\n![Oberoi Park View](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project4/proj_img-4_2.jpg \"Oberoi Park View\")\n\n[Oberoi Park View](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/oberoi-park-view-by-oberoi-realty-limited-in-kandivali-mumbai/)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2.55 Cr.\n\n2.0 BHK Flats & Apartments\n\n![Evershi