omjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n# Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B By: [Rustomjee Developers](/rustomjee-developers/builder/poex6x \"Rustomjee Developers\") in [Kandivali West](/kandivali-west-mumbai/rvp-52c256ec1614d \"Property in Kandivali West\")\n\nBy:\n[Rustomjee Developers](/rustomjee-developers/builder/poex6x \"Rustomjee Developers\") \nin\n[Kandivali West](/kandivali-west-mumbai/rvp-52c256ec1614d \"Property in Kandivali West\")\n\n## \n\n![rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai](https://teja12.kuikr.com/is/a/c/800x600/public/images/apartments/original_img/3nhv87.gif \"rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai\")\n![rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai](https://teja12.kuikr.com/is/a/c/132x99/gallery_images/original/5335c36de9f1b.jpg \"rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai\")\n![rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai](https://teja12.kuikr.com/is/a/c/132x99/gallery_images/original/5335c37b5287d.jpg \"rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai\")\n![rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai](https://teja12.kuikr.com/is/a/c/132x99/gallery_images/original/5335c38e9a1ce.jpg \"rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-mumbai\")\n\n## Location\n\n![Explore Now]()\n\n## \n\n## Properties in Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n## \n\n## About Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n**Discover Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B : Luxury Living in Kandivali West** .\n\n**Perfect Location** .\n\n**Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B**  is ideally situated in the heart of  **Kandivali West** , just off ITPL. This prime location offers unparalleled connectivity, making it easy to access  **Mumbai**  major IT hubs, schools, hospitals, and shopping malls. With the Kadugodi Tree Park Metro Station only 180 meters away, commuting has never been more convenient.\n\n**Spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK and 4 BHK Flats** .\n\nChoose from our spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK and 4 BHK flats that blend comfort and style. Each residence is designed to provide a serene living experience, surrounded by nature while being close to urban amenities. Enjoy thoughtfully designed layouts, high-quality finishes, and ample natural light, creating a perfect sanctuary for families.\n\n**A Lifestyle of Luxury and Community**.\n\nAt  **Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B** , you don’t just find a home; you embrace a lifestyle. The community features lush green spaces, recreational facilities, and a vibrant neighborhood that fosters a sense of belonging. Engage with like-minded individuals and enjoy a harmonious blend of luxury and community living.\n\n**Smart Investment Opportunity**.\n\nInvesting in  **Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B**  means securing a promising future. Located in one of  **Mumbai**  most dynamic locales, these residences not only offer a dream home but also hold significant appreciation potential. As  **Kandivali West**  continues to thrive, your investment is set to grow, making it a smart choice for homeowners and investors alike.\n\nWhy Choose Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B.\n\n•  **Prime Location:**  Adarsh Dugdhalaya Lane, Dominic Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, INDIA..\n\n•  **Community-Focused:**  Embrace a vibrant lifestyle.\n\n•  **Investment Potential:**  Great appreciation opportunities.\n\n**Project Overview**.\n\n•  **Bank Approval:**  All Leading Bank and Finance.\n\n•  **Government Approval:** .\n\n•  **Construction Status:**  completed.\n\n•  **Minimum Area:**  sq. ft.\n\n•  **Maximum Area:**  sq. ft.\n\no  **Minimum Price:**  Market Value.\n\no  **Maximum Price:**  Market Value.\n\n**Experience the Best of Kandivali West Living** .\n\nDon’t miss your chance to be a part of this exceptional community. Discover the perfect blend of luxury, connectivity, and nature at  **Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B** . Contact us today to learn more and schedule a visit!.\n\n## About The Builder :\n\n#702 Natraj, M. V. Road Junction, Western Express Highway, Andheri East, Mumbai - 400069, Maharashtra, INDIA.\n\nProjects in Mumbai\n\n## Other project by Rustomjee Developers :\n\n![]()\n\n### Rustomjee Elements\n\n![]()\n\n### Rustomjee Yazarina III\n\n![]()\n\n### Rustomjee Riviera\n\n![]()\n\n### Rustomjee