a's Premium Real Estate Portal]()\n\n## CommonFloor is Better on App!\n\nFind your Dream Home from **1.9L+ Projects**. Get **Unlimited Free Alerts** matching your needs.\n\n![Commonfloor App Promo]()\n![Powered by Quikr]()\n\nThe information provided herein have been collected from publicly\navailable sources, and is yet to be verified as per RERA guidelines.\\* [Read more..](javascript:void(0);)\n\nThe information sources used here include onsite interviews, marketing\nmaterial and other information sources on the internet. The information related\nto ownership of this property are also based on material gathered from public\nsources mentioned above or as has been declared to us by the owners/person\nlisting the property. These data have not yet been verified against\nauthentic documents, and are only indicative of the actual situation\nof this property, project or land holding, and their ownership.\n\nAt CommonFloor, we provide this information to help our users find\npublicly available data in a structured format. We are in the process\nof connecting with the relevant owners and verifying the data as per\nthe provisions of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016.\nWe will keep updating the information here regularly. While we believe\nthat the information provided to you is correct on the basis of the data\nprovided to us, please consider this data and information as indicative\nand use your judgement and verify any information before making any\ndecision.\n\n![Commonfloor - India's Premium Real Estate Portal]()\n\nCopyright © 2007-26 Commonfloor.com.  \nAll rights reserved.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/project-rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs","title":"Flats for Sale near Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B, Mumbai - Flats Price near Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B","raw_content":"# Flats for Sale near Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West Mumbai\n\nMultistorey apartment is